  "$comment": "T-4.13: mission-01 keeps greybox-01's encounter pacing and groups on the same named spawn zones. U-001 (2026-09-26): the defend objective has its own counterattack, `counterattack-push` — a rifleman into the compound every 40–65 s — sent by the script when the defend starts and stopped when it is won (`script` trigger, `stop-group`). Before, the counterattack was sent on the garrison's death, spent during the clear-and-hold, and the defend ran its whole five and a half minutes on an empty map. `counterattack` still answers the garrison's fall, to contest the hold. The old `counterattack-support` pair held its post in a zone no human can see and never met the squad, so it is gone. A group down to one survivor for 45 s counts as beaten to what waits on it.",
